<h2>12. Model Data (ERD Ringkas)</h2>
<p><strong>Inti Sales:</strong> <code>customers</code> ─&lt; <code>bookings</code> &gt;─ <code>units</code> (─ <code>clusters</code>/<code>blocks</code>/<code>unit_types</code>); <code>bookings</code> ─&lt; <code>contracts</code> (PPJB) ─&lt; <code>contract_documents</code>, <code>contract_gimmicks</code>; <code>bookings</code> ─&lt; <code>payment_allocations</code> (TTS/Memo/VA); <code>nup_registrations</code>, <code>holds</code>.</p>
<p><strong>Inti Akuntansi:</strong> <code>bs_accounts</code> (CoA 6 level) ─&lt; <code>bs_journal_lines</code> &gt;─ <code>bs_journals</code> (header; + <code>cost_center_id, department_id, ledger_id, location_id, currency, kurs</code>). Sub-ledger: <code>bs_ap_invoices</code>(+lines/schedules/payments), <code>bs_ar_invoices</code>(+lines/schedules/payments), <code>bs_fixed_assets</code>(+depreciation_entries), <code>bs_stock_*</code>, <code>bs_purchase_orders</code>(+lines), <code>bs_work_orders</code>(+progress/addendums/materials/progress_mutations), <code>bs_budgets</code>(+mutations), <code>bs_cogs_recognitions</code>, <code>bs_payroll_runs</code>(+lines), <code>bs_cash_transactions</code>, <code>bs_cash_advances</code>, <code>bs_giros</code>, <code>bs_fiscal_periods</code>.</p>
<p><strong>Fondasi:</strong> <code>users</code>, <code>roles</code>, <code>permissions</code> (Spatie), <code>tenants</code>, audit trail, <code>numerators</code>, <code>parameters</code>. <strong>Total 72 tabel.</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>Setiap entitas finansial menyimpan <code>journal_id</code> (referensi ke jurnal GL yang dibentuknya) → telusur lengkap transaksi ↔ buku besar.</p>
</blockquote>
