<h2>17. Penomoran Dokumen (Numerator)</h2>
<p>Format multi-pola per jenis &amp; periode, otomatis &amp; unik. Contoh nyata:</p>
<ul>
<li>Booking: <code>BK/JRES/YYMM/00007</code> · Customer: <code>CUST/2026/00039</code></li>
<li>AP Invoice: <code>AP.INV/&lt;KATEGORI&gt;/MUP/YY/&lt;ROMAWI-BULAN&gt;/00016</code> · AP Kuitansi: <code>AP.KUI/MUP/YY/&lt;ROMAWI&gt;/00002</code></li>
<li>AR Invoice: <code>AR.INV/PENJUALAN-UNIT/MUP/YY/&lt;ROMAWI&gt;/00002</code></li>
<li>SPK: <code>SPK/YYMM/0003</code> · Fixed Asset: <code>FA/YYMM/0001</code> · HPP: <code>HPP/YYMM/0001</code> · Payroll: <code>PAY/YYMM/0001</code></li>
</ul>
<p>Pola dikelola di modul <strong>Numerator</strong> (Settings) + <strong>Numerator Preview</strong>.</p>
<hr />
<h2>18. Pengujian &amp; Kriteria Penerimaan</h2>
<p><strong>Otomatis (built-in):</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong><code>php artisan smoke:pages</code></strong> — render <strong>171 halaman</strong> harus 200/OK (0 FAIL).</li>
<li><strong><code>php artisan trial:all</code></strong> — <strong>24 skenario alur inti</strong> (booking→approval, TTS→kuitansi, KPA, legal, komisi, exception, settings, dll.) harus PASS.</li>
<li><strong><code>npm run build</code></strong> — kompilasi frontend tanpa error.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>E2E akuntansi (terverifikasi):</strong> 8 siklus, <strong>39 sub-transaksi</strong> menembus controller asli (validasi→otorisasi→service→jurnal→GL) — SPK, Aset, AR, AP, COGS RealCost, Budget, Cash Book/Kas Kecil, Giro, Bon Sementara, Payroll, Tutup Buku — <strong>seluruh jurnal seimbang</strong>, integritas GL terjaga.</p>
<p><strong>Kriteria penerimaan rilis:</strong> smoke 171/171 ✔ · trial 24/24 ✔ · build clean ✔ · E2E jurnal balanced ✔ · tidak ada error <code>APP_DEBUG</code> di produksi.</p>
<hr />
<h2>19. Deployment &amp; Operasional</h2>
<p>Rinci di <strong><code>DEPLOY.md</code></strong> + <strong><code>MULAI-DISINI.md</code></strong>. Ringkas:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Server selalu-nyala</strong> (rekomendasi gratis: <strong>Oracle Cloud Always Free</strong>), Ubuntu + <strong>PHP 8.4 + Caddy (HTTPS otomatis)</strong>.</li>
<li>Artefak siap pakai: <code>deploy/Caddyfile</code>, <code>deploy/deploy.sh</code> (rilis/update 1 perintah), <code>deploy/javacore-worker.service</code> (queue), <code>.env.production.example</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Scheduler</strong> via cron (<code>* * * * * php artisan schedule:run</code>) untuk jatuh tempo/expire otomatis.</li>
<li><strong>Backup</strong> DB harian + uji restore.</li>
<li>Update aplikasi: <code>bash deploy/deploy.sh</code> (maintenance → pull → build → migrate → online).</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>20. Roadmap, Di Luar Lingkup &amp; Risiko</h2>
<p><strong>Roadmap potensial:</strong> migrasi DB ke MySQL/PostgreSQL untuk skala besar; integrasi bank host-to-host; BI/analitik; aplikasi mobile; e-Meterai; tanda tangan digital legal.</p>
<p><strong>Risiko &amp; mitigasi:</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Risiko</th>
<th>Mitigasi</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Konkurensi tulis SQLite (&quot;database is locked&quot;)</td>
<td>WAL + busy_timeout; siap migrasi MySQL</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Ketergantungan Chromium (PDF) di server kecil</td>
<td>Pasang Chromium / degradasi anggun</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Ketersediaan kapasitas Oracle Free (ARM)</td>
<td>Fallback region/AD lain atau GCP e2-micro</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Kesalahan periode/jurnal</td>
<td>Validasi balance + kunci periode + approval lifecycle</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr />
