<h2>Lampiran A — Peta Route Lengkap (per modul)</h2>
<p><strong>Auth/Publik:</strong> login, login.attempt, webhooks.xendit, nup.create, nup.public.store, nup.public.done, regions.children, dashboard.</p>
<p><strong>CRM:</strong> crm.leads.{index,create,store,show,update,move,convert,activity,lost}.</p>
<p><strong>Security (modul SDM lapangan):</strong> security.{index,log,matrikulasi.company,matrikulasi.project,matrikulasi.toggle,absensi,absensi.store,jobhistory,jobhistory.store,technical,technical.store,technical.update}.</p>
<p><strong>Setup Sales:</strong> setup-sales.{index,dashboard,reminder,log}; scheme.{preview,index,create,store,show,edit,update,destroy}; sales.{index,store,update,destroy}; agent.{index,store,update,destroy}; pricelist.{index,create,units,store,show,activate,destroy}; reports.{index,master-sales,price-list,history-price,summary-stock,master-unit}; calculator.{index,bphtb,kpr,skema}; audit.record; activity.{index,store}.</p>
<p><strong>Customer/Sales/Reports:</strong> reports.{index,detail,summary,export}; customers.{merge,merge.references,merge.apply,upload,upload.template,upload.store}; cif.{index,show}; siteplan.{show,update}.</p>
<p><strong>Hold/NUP/Booking:</strong> holds.{index,create,store,release}; nup.{index,verifikasi,show,bayar,pay,refund,verify,destroy}; bookings.{preview,cancel,promote,gn,gu,reschedule}.</p>
<p><strong>Contract/PPJB/Gimmick/Ops:</strong> contracts.{index,show,update,print,sign,ppjb.print,ppjb.start-signing,ppjb.complete,ppjb.numbering,documents.toggle,gimmicks.apply-package}; gimmicks.{toggle-diterima,remove}; sales.kontrak-ops.{index,find,ppn,ppn.preview,ppn.apply,operation,apply}; sales.migrasi.{index,template,upload}; exceptions.index.</p>
<p><strong>Finance FO:</strong> tts.{index,create,store,show,post,clear-giro,reject-giro}; kuitansi.{index,show,pdf}; memos.{free-dp,subsidi-dp,cancel}; cashbacks.{index,store,approve,pay}; refunds.{index,approve,pay}; faktur-pajak.{index,create,store}; va.{index,assign,transactions,anonymous,anonymous.allocate}; rekening.{index,store,update,destroy}.</p>
<p><strong>Collection:</strong> followups.{index,store}; dendas.index; denda.{perumusan,perumusan.update,pemutihan,pemutihan.waive}; pjt.{index,regenerate}; tunggakan.index; sp.{index,issue}; skl.{index,issue,pdf}.</p>
<p><strong>KPA:</strong> kpa.setup.retensi.{index,store,update,destroy}; kpa.setup.bank.{index,create,store,edit,update,destroy}; kpa.{index,create,store,show,submit,sp3k,akad,akad-complete}.</p>
<p><strong>Business Support — Master:</strong> bs.index; bs.accounts.{index,store,update,destroy}; bs.cost-centers.<em>; bs.journal-dimensions.</em>; bs.suppliers.*.</p>
<p><strong>BS — Inventory/PO:</strong> bs.inv.setup.<em>; bs.items.</em>; bs.fpb.{index,create,store,show,approve}; bs.receipt.{index,create,store}; bs.issue.{index,create,store}; bs.stockcard.index; bs.po.{index,create,store,show,approve,close,revise,termin,adjust-ppn}.</p>
<p><strong>BS — GL/Tax/Closing:</strong> bs.gl.{index,period.close,period.open,journal.index,journal.create,journal.store,journal.show,journal.finalize,journal.approve,journal.reject,journal.import,journal.import.store,extra,ledger,trialbalance,financials,cashflow,worksheet,comparative}; bs.tax.{rekap,keluaran,masukan,nsfp,export.keluaran,export.masukan,cetak.ppn,cetak.buku,cetak.pph,efaktur.csv,efaktur.xml,dashboard,pph,pph.export}; bs.closing.{index,neraca,saldoawal,saldoawal.csv,close,reopen,year}.</p>
<p><strong>BS — AP:</strong> bs.ap.{index,create,store,aging,card,categories.*,kuitansi.{index,create,store,show,void},posting.{index,po,spk},memorial.{index,create,store},penghapusan.{index,store},berkas.{index,store,update,destroy,toggle},show,pay}.</p>
<p><strong>BS — AR:</strong> bs.ar.{index,create,store,aging,card,categories.*,kuitansi.{index,create,store,show,void},memorial.{index,create,store},penghapusan.{index,store},show,pay,reschedule}.</p>
<p><strong>BS — Kas/Aset/Lainnya:</strong> bs.cashbook.{index,balances,create,store,show}; bs.pettycash.{index,create,store}; bs.bankrec.{index,store,show,toggle,finalize}; bs.advance.{index,create,store,show,realize,refund,reimburse}; bs.giro.{index,create,store,show,clear,bounce}; bs.fa.{index,create,store,run,run.store,show,depreciate,dispose,sell,opening}; bs.budget.{index,store,update,destroy,submit,approve,mutate}; bs.bulk.{form,store}; bs.employees.*; bs.payroll.{index,store,show}; bs.cogs.{index,store,realcost,realcost.post}; bs.projection; bs.spk.{index,create,store,show,progress,progress.pay,retensi,addendum,adjust-ppn,cancel,material,mutate-progress}; bs.module.</p>
