<h2>Lampiran B — Peran &amp; Domain Permission</h2>
<p><strong>11 Peran:</strong> SuperAdmin, Direktur, Admin, SalesDirector, SalesManager, Sales, Agent, FinanceManager, Finance, Collection, Viewer.</p>
<p><strong>193 Permission</strong> dalam 15 domain: <code>system, master, sales, finance, collection, bankloan, legal, commission, approval, reporting, businesssupport, crm, security, setupsales, incentive</code>. Pola: <code>&lt;domain&gt;.&lt;aksi&gt;</code> (mis. <code>businesssupport.view</code>, <code>businesssupport.transaction.create</code>, <code>businesssupport.setup.manage</code>, <code>businesssupport.approval.act</code>).</p>
